            "title": "Lesson #9 - Copy",
            "id": 130770,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Koda daha fazla açıklık ve güvenlik kazandırmak için türlere ad vermek üzere <strong>tür takma adlarını</strong> kullanırız. <strong>Tür takma adlarını</strong><code>type</code> anahtar sözcüğünü kullanarak tanımlarız.</p><p>Örneğin, karmaşık bir nesne türüne bir ad verebiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Human = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  age: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"4\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>type</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9 - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 130772,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>type</code> anahtar kelimesinden sonra türümüzün adını tanımlarız.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Human\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"10\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>type</code>, ardından <code>Human</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9 - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 130771,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ardından türü tanımlayabiliriz. <code>string</code> türünde <code>name</code> adlı bir özniteliğe sahip bir nesne türü tanımlayalım.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Human = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"33\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>{</code>, ardından <code>name: string;</code> ve son olarak <code>};</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9 - Copy - Copy - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 130804,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Özel <code>Human</code> türümüze <code>number</code> türünde başka bir özellik ekleyelim.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Human = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  age: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"string\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\",\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"45\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>age</code>, ardından <code>:</code> ve son olarak <code>number;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9 - Copy - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 130773,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Artık özel türü, diğer türler gibi kullanabiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Human = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  age: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" jacky: Human = {name: \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jacky&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", age: \" /><text value=\"63\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(jacky);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{name: &quot;Jacky&quot;, age: 63}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>:</code>, ardından <code>Human</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 130595,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mevcut bir türe yeni bir ad vermek için tür takma adlarını da kullanabiliriz. Sayılardan oluşan bir dizi için bir tür takma adı oluşturalım.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" PriceSeries = \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"[];\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"custom\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>type</code>, ardından <code>=</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 130596,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Artık tür takma adımız olduğuna göre, değişkenlere tür açıklaması eklemek için onu kullanabiliriz. Hadi dene.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" PriceSeries = \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"[];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" stockPrices: PriceSeries = [\" /><text value=\"108\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"103\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"110\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(stockPrices);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"number[]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[108, 103, 110]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>PriceSeries</code>, ardından <code>PriceSeries</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
